Say what repairs a run was offered, and write the ones that hold up

Usage: mjutest fix [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --run <RUN>           The run whose candidates to read. The latest by default
      --apply               Write the candidates that hold up, rather than only saying what they are
      --candidate <DIGEST>  Write only this candidate, by its digest or any prefix that names
                            exactly one
      --offline             Never touch the network
      --locked              Refuse to change `Cargo.lock`
  -h, --help                Print help
